      <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Prophet of da Great Waaagh! (Aura)&quot; hit=+1 when=melee aura=6
sim-mod: source=&quot;Prophet of da Great Waaagh! (Aura)&quot; wound=+1 when=melee aura=6
invuln: 4+
must-warlord</comment>
      <constraints>
