<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Extra Sneaky Upgrade" hidden="false" id="0d1a-9f3b-7c40-a020">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Runt Swarm) : porteurs = unites GRETCHIN (aucune datasheet GRETCHIN dans le catalogue actuellement — rattacher via des groupes "Runt Swarm Enhancement" par datasheet au retour des Gretchin ; cumulable, max 1 par unite, jamais Epic Hero). pts: a confirmer via MFM (placeholder 0).</comment>
  <profiles>
    <profile name="Extra Sneaky Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-9f3b-7c40-a119">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*A lifetime of evading the attentions of Orks and even other runts has honed these Grots' sneakiness to preternatural levels.*

**^^Gretchin^^** unit only. This unit has -3&quot; **detection range**.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
  </profiles>
  <categoryLinks>
    <categoryLink name="Enhancement" hidden="false" id="0d1a-9f3b-7c40-a120" targetId="6226-9b9b-107a-9ada" primary="false"/>
  </categoryLinks>
