      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Rebellious, lazy or just plain unlucky Gretchin are driven into dangerous vanguard duties. These runts scarper forward with the hope of making it through as quickly as possible.*

**^^Gretchin^^** unit only. While this unit is not embarked, this unit has **Scouts 6&quot;**.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
  </profiles>
