<profile name="Bomb Squigs" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e10d-0051">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**Once per turn, twice per battle, per unit.** In your Movement phase, when this unit ends a **normal move**, you can select one **visible** enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit and roll one D6:
- On a 3+, that enemy unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.

Place two Bomb Squig tokens next to the unit, removing one each time this ability is used.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
<profile name="Trophy Hunters" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e10d-0052">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit has +1 to **charge rolls**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
