<selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Mek Gunz" hidden="false" id="b37a-8686-db2c-8cbd">
<comment>invuln: 6+
pts: inconnu (ancien MFM basePts=0, prix par modele - a confirmer). Valeurs des canons lues sur photo floue - a confirmer.</comment>
<constraints>
<constraint type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="0d1a-e10e-0034"/>
</constraints>
<profiles>
<profile name="Madcap Artillery" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e10e-0030">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, when this unit has shot, if all ranged weapons equipped by each Mek Gun model in this unit are the same, select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit has the ability below that matches that weapon&apos;s name until the start of your next turn:
- **Bubblechukka**: This unit is **wobbled**. While a **wobbled** unit is attacking, its targets have the **benefit of cover** against those attacks.
- **Kustom Mega-kannon**: This unit is **zapped**. While a unit is **zapped**, that unit has -1 **Ld**.
- **Smasha Gun**: This unit is **smashed**. While a unit is **smashed**, that unit has -2&quot; **M**.
- **Traktor Kannon**: This unit is **grounded**. While a unit is **grounded**, it cannot **take to the skies**.

Place five Grot Crew tokens next to each Mek Gun model, removing one each time its Mek Gun model loses a wound (a Mek Gun model itself is considered to represent its final wound).</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
