<profile name="Fix Dat Armour Up" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e111-0043">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**Once per battle, per unit.** In your Command phase, this unit **heals** 3 wounds.

Place a Grot Oiler token next to the unit, removing it when this ability is used.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
<profile name="More Dakka" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e111-0044">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit&apos;s ranged attacks have:
- **[IGNORES COVER]**.
- If this unit is **riled up**, **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
