<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Smoky Gubbinz Upgrade" hidden="false" id="8e84-a731-d51d-73c2">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Kult of Speed) : unites SPEED FREEKS hors AIRCRAFT, cumulable, max 1 par unite, jamais Epic Hero. pts: 15 (ancien MFM 10e, provisoire).</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Smoky Gubbinz Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e113-0057">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*These loud, fume-belching devices wreathe those in the Speed Freeks&apos; wake in a thick bank of obscuring smoke.*

**^^Speed Freeks^^** unit only (excluding **^^Aircraft^^** units). When an attack targets a unit that is not **fully visible** to the attacking model because of a model in this unit, the target has the **benefit of cover** against that attack.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
  <categoryLinks>
