<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Temperamental Shokka Upgrade" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e113-0000-0021">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Madcap Meks) : BIG MEK WITH SHOKK ATTACK GUN uniquement - datasheet absente du catalogue actuellement, rattachement a faire a son retour. pts placeholder 0.</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Temperamental Shokka Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e113-0059">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Shokk attack guns are notoriously unreliable, and even with a supposedly enhanced set of wonky bits, this Big Mek is never certain what will happen when he sets the thing off.*

**^^Big Mek with Shokk Attack Gun^^** model only. In your Shooting phase, when this unit is **selected to shoot**, you can roll one D6:
- On a 1, this model&apos;s Shokk Attack Gun weapon has **[TORRENT]**, and when this unit has shot, this model is **destroyed**.
- On a 2-5, this model&apos;s Shokk Attack Gun weapon has +1 **A**.
- On a 6, this model&apos;s Shokk Attack Gun weapon has **[SUSTAINED HITS 2]**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
  <categoryLinks>
<categoryLink name="Enhancement" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e113-0060" targetId="6226-9b9b-107a-9ada" primary="false"/>
  </categoryLinks>
