<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Wimp-Kickaz Upgrade" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0000-0021">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Bully Boyz) : unite NOBZ, cumulable, max 1 par unite, jamais Epic Hero. pts: a confirmer via MFM (placeholder 0).</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Wimp-Kickaz Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0057">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Any snivelling gitz attempting to back away from a good fight with these arrogant Nobz get a good kicking to see them on their way.*

**^^Nobz^^** unit only. When an enemy unit **engaged** with this unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**:
- That enemy unit must select the **desperate escape** mode.
- If this unit is **riled up**, that enemy unit has -1 to the **hazard rolls** made for that **desperate escape**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
