<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Throat-Slittas Upgrade" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0000-0022">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Taktikal Brigade) : unites KOMMANDOS/STORMBOYZ, cumulable, max 1 par unite, jamais Epic Hero. Rattachement Stormboyz a faire quand la fiche sera ajoutee. pts: a confirmer via MFM (placeholder 0).</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Throat-Slittas Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0059">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Veterans of the relatively organised butchery of well-protected targets, these distrusted Orks make excellent forward assassins.*

**^^Kommandos^^**/**^^Stormboyz^^** unit only. This unit&apos;s melee attacks have **[LETHAL HITS: non-MONSTER/VEHICLE]**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
