<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Flyboss Upgrade" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0000-0024">
  <comment>Amelioration Upgrade (Flyboyz) : unites ORKS AIRCRAFT, cumulable, max 1 par unite, jamais Epic Hero. Rattachement a faire quand les fiches d&apos;aircraft seront ajoutees. pts: a confirmer via MFM (placeholder 0).</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Flyboss Upgrade" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0063">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Brutish aces who have survived enough dogfights to rise to positions of superiority, Flybosses inspire other Ork aviators to heights of psychotic enthusiasm.*

**^^Orks^^ ^^Aircraft^^** unit only.
- This unit has **^^Character^^**.
- When this unit ends an **ingress move**, each friendly **^^Orks^^ ^^Aircraft^^**/**^^Deffkoptas^^** unit within 6&quot; of this unit is **riled up** until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
