<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*With a lifetime of picking fights with the galaxy&apos;s most lethal fighters behind him, and a gnarled hide thicker than Battlewagon armour, this Ork has survived blows that would fell an Ambull.*

