<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Roiling energies frequently erupt from this Weirdboy&apos;s eyes, solidifying above the enemy into the huge green foot of Gork (or Mork) himself, which repeatedly stomps on the foe.*

