<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Where most Weirdboyz would quite like to be left alone, so-called Warpheads become addicted to the danger, intentionally supercharging their tortured minds and revelling in venting dangerously unpredictable powers.*

