<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*This war leader is a glowering incarnation of violence, his brutality so contagious that when he bellows his blind fury and releases his pent-up aggression, Orks nearby are excitedly swept along with him.*

**^^Orks^^** model only. **(Once per battle, per army)** In your Movement phase, you can use this ability. If you do, this unit is **riled up** until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
