<selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Kill Kommanda" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0000-0012">
  <comment>pts: a confirmer via MFM (placeholder 0) - amelioration nouvelle.</comment>
  <profiles>
<profile name="Kill Kommanda" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0d1a-e115-0047">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">*Possessed of exceptional kunnin&apos; and a weird obsession with sneakin&apos; about, this powerful Ork leader loves nothing more than creeping through enemy defences before carving a bloody path through their lines.*

**^^Big Mek^^**/**^^Warboss^^** **^^Infantry^^** model only. While this model is part of an **attached** unit, this model has:
- **Infiltrators**.
- **Stealth**.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
  </profiles>
  <modifiers>
<modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
