                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Weirdboy^^** or **^^Wurrboy^^** model only. Each time the bearer makes a Psychic Attack, add 1 to the Hit roll and if that attack destroys one or more enemy models, the bearer regains up to 2 lost wounds.</characteristic>
