                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In the Fight phase, each time an enemy unit is selected to fight, if this unit was selected as the target of one or more of the attack unit&apos;s attacks, after those attacks have been resolved, roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
